 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one universally “best” title company—it depends on your lender’s requirements, location, availability, and fees. **Title Resources Inc.** looks like a strong option based on the results available: it reports a **5.0 Google rating from 92 reviews**, with customers praising responsiveness and clear explanations at closing.\n\nOther St. Louis-area options to compare include **Investors Title**, **Security Title**, and **Clear Title Group**. Before choosing, ask each for an itemized estimate of title and closing fees, confirm they can meet your closing date, and check that your lender will work with them. Your purchase contract may also specify who selects the title company.",
